{"id":"948baa6012a2165e3bc7b20078b1dfc6abb04a0c","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"948baa6012a2165e3bc7b20078b1dfc6abb04a0c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/projects-graph-follows-overrides.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/hooks.read-package-hook\": patch","+\"@pnpm/workspace.projects-graph\": patch","+\"@pnpm/workspace.projects-filter\": patch","+\"@pnpm/installing.commands\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+The workspace project graph now follows `overrides`. An override that points a dependency at a workspace package, such as `foo: workspace:*`, makes that package a dependency of every project whose declaration the override matches, even with `linkWorkspacePackages` off. `pnpm install` now runs that package's lifecycle scripts before the scripts of the projects depending on it. `pnpm -r run` orders the projects the same way. `--filter` selectors that follow dependencies now see the edge."],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm-lock.yaml","lines":["@@ -6536,6 +6536,8 @@ snapshots:"," \t\t\t\"dependencies\": {"," \t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/catalogs.resolver\": \"workspace:*\","," \t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/catalogs.types\": \"workspace:*\",","+\t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/config.parse-overrides\": \"workspace:*\",","+\t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/hooks.read-package-hook\": \"workspace:*\","," \t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/npm-package-arg\": \"catalog:\","," \t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/resolving.npm-resolver\": \"workspace:*\","," \t\t\t\t\"@pnpm/types\": \"workspace:*\","],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipeline.rs","lines":["@@ -38,9 +38,7 @@ use pnpm_package_manager::{"," use pnpm_reporter::{LogEvent, LogLevel, PnpmLog};"," use pnpm_workspace::{GraphPkg, Project};"," use pnpm_workspace_projects_filter::{GetChangedProjectsOptions, get_changed_projects};","-use pnpm_workspace_projects_graph::{","-    CreateProjectsGraphOptions, ProjectGraph, create_projects_graph,","-};","+use pnpm_workspace_projects_gr